      "message": "Sir, we need to use add_interrupt_randomness() to speep up random crng initialization for the optimization of system startup. Because the boringssl_self_test will block for 2.5s when the entropy pool has not been initialized.\n\nlog as follows:\n\n17:35:41.563   193   193 W         : boringssl_self_test_fast\n17:35:41.571   193   193 W \u003cunknown\u003e: getrandom indicates that the entropy pool has not been initialized. Rather than continue with poor entropy, this process will block until entropy is available.\n17:35:44.024     0     0 I [    C1] random: crng init done\n17:35:44.045   193   193 W         : boringssl_self_test_rsa",
